Type: Package
Package: SMED
Title: Statistical Modelling of co-elution Mass Spectrometry Data
Version: 1.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Qingzhou", "Zhang", , "zqzneptune@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Assigning probability scores to co-eluted proteins from
    biochemical fractionation mass spectrometry (BF-MS) experiments to
    infer protein-protein interactions. The package integrates
    information-theoretic and statistical co-elution metrics using
    advanced machine learning models like XGBoost and Random Forest.
